  "instructions": "No License Nearby is an artist-owned sync licensing catalog of 882 tracks where the artist owns 100% of every master and every publishing share, so one license clears the music. These tools let you search the catalog, audition tracks, see live prices and build a quote. Buying happens on the No License Nearby website by submitting a license request; this MCP never submits license requests and never takes payment. No API key is needed.",
